  "_drills": "Selectable drills. type 'remedies' = random guard then a remedy from that guard. 'sequence' = fixed steps spoken in order and looped; once=true steps are only called on the first round. 'outcomes' = each round picks one outcome (balanced) and speaks its steps; vs is shown on screen. 'staged' = random calls from a pool that grows: items with stage n join after perStage*(n-1) calls. A step shows a guard photo (guard, or show to display a guard while speaking its own text) or the cut diagram (cut, ends); otherwise text only. A step may also name its own photo (img = a file in photos/, without .jpg). Drills are listed basic to advanced; group is the section header shown above them in the picker.",
